  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Choosing a Song</h2>\n<p>They are discussing which song to sing. One person suggests &#x27;Dry Flower,&#x27; while another suggests &#x27;Attack No. 1.&#x27; There is some disagreement about whether &#x27;Attack No. 1&#x27; is a ballad.</p>\n<p>One person is confused about the suggestion of &#x27;Attack No. 1&#x27; and points out the difficulty of singing in Japanese. They also mention that the success rate of singing might be about half.</p>\n<p>They consider singing &#x27;Love&#x27; or &#x27;Snow Flower&#x27; and suggest using a poll to decide which song to sing.</p>\n<p>They create a poll and give options for the audience to choose from. The final choice is made based on the poll results.</p>\n<p>At the end of the discussion, they decide to proceed with the chosen song and close the discussion.</p>\n<p>There are some additional comments and reactions, such as expressing that singing is fun and that the culture of singing is great.</p>\n<h2>Additional Comments and Reactions</h2>\n<p>Some people mention that singing in Japanese feels strange or that they are unsure about the success rate of singing. Others express that singing is enjoyable and that the culture of singing is great.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4__3dh2J0eg</p>",
